 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\" class=\"no-js\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no\">\n    <meta name=\"csrf-token\" content=\"1795716005:w90PtQ2ZKupW+Nxrdoi8Sk9VmTi8oquQDemlkerQ9dk=\">\n    <meta name=\"renderer\" content=\"webkit\">\n    <script>\n        window.__feInitLocalTime = new Date().getTime() / 1000;\n        window.__feConfigVersion = '74d532c6c7861bfe'; window.__feConfigRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/config'; window.__fePhoneHomeCall = 'https\\u003A\\/\\/moshimoshi\\u003Aagltb3noatpwohhuenb5ag1tc2jsnnl3\\u0040errtrack.luogu.com.cn\\/lotlp1';        window.__luoguTagVersion = 'zh\\u002DCN\\/2026112601'; window.__luoguTagRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/tags';\n    </script>\n    <title>题解：P1425 小鱼的游泳时间 - 洛谷专栏</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/favicon.ico\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'unsafe-eval' 'unsafe-inline' luogu.com *.luogu.com luogu.com.cn *.luogu.com.cn luogu.org *.luogu.org wss: blob: luoguprivate.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com luogu.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.dun.163yun.com https://*.dun.163.com https://*.nosdn.126.net https://*.nosdn.127.net https://nos.netease.com https://cstaticdun.126.net https://cstaticdun1.126.net https://cstaticdun-v6.126.net https://acstatic-dun.126.net; img-src * data:; font-src * data:; worker-src data: blob:; frame-src https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn https://player.bilibili.com https://www.bilibili.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com\">\n        <script id=\"lentille-context\" type=\"application/json\">{\"instance\":\"main\",\"template\":\"article.show\",\"status\":200,\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"data\":{\"article\":{\"lid\":\"beuv9jew\",\"title\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\\uff1aP1425 \\u5c0f\\u9c7c\\u7684\\u6e38\\u6cf3\\u65f6\\u95f4\",\"category\":2,\"time\":1747130884,\"author\":{\"uid\":1760084,\"avatar\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/usericon\\/1760084.png\",\"name\":\"MingDynasty_xiaohao2\",\"slogan\":\"\\u8fd9\\u4e2a\\u78a7\\u742a\\u5f88\\u52e4\\u594b\\uff0cIOI\\u90fdAK\\u4e86\\uff0c\\u575a\\u6301\\u58f6\\u5173\\uff0c\\u5fd8\\u5173\\u79c1\\u4fe1\\uff0c\\u6ce8\\u610f\\uff01\\uff01\\uff01\\uff1aMingDynasty_xiaohao2\\u4e0d\\u662fMingDynasty\\u84dd\\u540d\\u7684\\u5c0f\\u53f7\\uff0c \\u7c89\\u798f\\uff1a\\/article\\/0g2zuf25\",\"badge\":null,\"isAdmin\":false,\"isBanned\":false,\"color\":\"Blue\",\"ccfLevel\":0,\"xcpcLevel\":0,\"background\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/image_hosting\\/yiemsfdk.png\"},\"upvote\":0,\"replyCount\":0,\"favorCount\":0,\"status\":2,\"solutionFor\":{\"pid\":\"P1425\",\"type\":\"P\",\"name\":\"\\u5c0f\\u9c7c\\u7684\\u6e38\\u6cf3\\u65f6\\u95f4\",\"difficulty\":1,\"fullScore\":100},\"promoteStatus\":0,\"collection\":null,\"content\":\"[\\u9898\\u76ee\\u4f20\\u9001\\u95e8](https:\\/\\/www.luogu.com.cn\\/problem\\/P1425)\\n\\n## \\u89e3\\u9898\\u601d\\u8def\\uff1a\\n\\u8fd9\\u9053\\u9898\\u5c31\\u662f\\u7b97\\u4e24\\u4e2a\\u65f6\\u95f4\\u7684\\u5dee\\u3002\\n\\n#### \\u8bbe\\uff1a a = \\u5f00\\u59cb\\u5206\\uff0c b = \\u5f00\\u59cb\\u65f6\\uff0c c = \\u6700\\u7ec8\\u5206\\uff0c d = \\u6700\\u7ec8\\u65f6, x = \\u65f6\\u7684\\u5dee\\uff0c y = \\u5206\\u7684\\u5dee\\u3002\\n\\n\\u4e3b\\u8981\\u8981\\u5224\\u65ad\\u5206\\u662f\\u5426\\u9700\\u8981\\u501f\\u4f4d\\u3002\\n1. \\u5982\\u679c\\u8981\\u501f\\u4f4d\\uff0c\\u5219 d-1 \\uff0c c+60-a \\u5c31\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u7b97\\u51fa y \\u3002\\n2. \\u5982\\u679c\\u4e0d\\u9700\\u8981\\u7ed3\\u5c3e\\uff0c\\u76f4\\u63a5 c-a \\u5373\\u53ef\\u7b97\\u51fa y \\u3002\\n\\n\\u4e4b\\u540e\\u76f4\\u63a5 d-b \\u5373\\u53ef\\u7b97\\u51fa x \\u3002\\n\\n### \\u4ee3\\u7801\\u90e8\\u5206\\uff1a\\n```cpp\\n#include\\u003Cbits\\/stdc++.h\\u003E\\nusing namespace std;\\nint main(){\\n\\tint a,b,c,d;\\n\\tcin\\u003E\\u003Ea\\u003E\\u003Eb\\u003E\\u003Ec\\u003E\\u003Ed;\\n\\tint x,y;\\/\\/\\u7528\\u65f6\\n\\tif(d\\u003E=b){\\/\\/\\u4e0d\\u9700\\u8981\\u501f\\u4f4d \\n\\t\\t y=d-b;\\n\\t} \\n\\telse{\\/\\/\\u9700\\u8981\\u501f\\u4f4d \\n\\t\\td+=60;\\n\\t\\ty=d-b;\\n\\t\\tc--;\\n\\t}\\n\\tx=c-a;\\/\\/\\u6700\\u7ec8\\u65f6\\u95f4\\u4e00\\u5b9a\\u5927\\u4e8e\\u5f00\\u59cb\\u65f6\\u95f4 \\n\\tcout\\u003C\\u003Cx\\u003C\\u003C\\u0022 \\u0022\\u003C\\u003Cy;\\/\\/\\u8f93\\u51fa \\n\\treturn 0;\\n}\",\"contentFull\":true,\"adminNote\":null},\"favored\":false,\"voted\":null,\"canReply\":false,\"canEdit\":false},\"user\":null,\"time\":1795629605.593751}</script>            <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.css\" />\n    <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/vendor.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/beuv9jew\" />\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\\uff1aP1425 \\u5c0f\\u9c7c\\u7684\\u6e38\\u6cf3\\u65f6\\u95f4\",\"description\":\"\\u9898\\u76ee\\u4f20\\u9001\\u95e8\\n\\u89e3\\u9898\\u601d\\u8def\\uff1a\\n\\u8fd9\\u9053\\u9898\\u5c31\\u662f\\u7b97\\u4e24\\u4e2a\\u65f6\\u95f4\\u7684\\u5dee\\u3002\\n\\u8bbe\\uff1a a = \\u5f00\\u59cb\\u5206\\uff0c b = \\u5f00\\u59cb\\u65f6\\uff0c c = \\u6700\\u7ec8\\u5206\\uff0c d = \\u6700\\u7ec8\\u65f6, x = \\u65f6\\u7684\\u5dee\\uff0c y = \\u5206\\u7684\\u5dee\\u3002\\n\\u4e3b\\u8981\\u8981\\u5224\\u65ad\\u5206\\u662f\\u5426\\u9700\\u8981\\u501f\\u4f4d\\u3002\\n\\n\\u5982\\u679c\\u8981\\u501f\\u4f4d\\uff0c\\u5219 d-1 \\uff0c c+60-a \\u5c31\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u7b97\\u51fa\\u2026\",\"genre\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"MingDynasty_xiaohao2\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-05-13T18:08:04+08:00\"}</script>\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"题解：P1425 小鱼的游泳时间\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"题目传送门\n解题思路：\n这道题就是算两个时间的差。\n设： a = 开始分， b = 开始时， c = 最终分， d = 最终时, x = 时的差， y = 分的差。\n主要要判断分是否需要借位。\n\n如果要借位，则 d-1 ， c+60-a 就可以算出…\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:section\" content=\"题解\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:author\" content=\"MingDynasty_xiaohao2\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-05-13T18:08:04+08:00\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/beuv9jew\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"洛谷专栏\" />\n        <script id=\"luogu-theme\" type=\"application/json\">{\"id\":1,\"lNavi\":{\"back\":\"#ffffff\",\"fore\":\"#262626\",\"logo\":null},\"lBody\":{\"back\":\"#f0f4fa\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-l.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}},\"dNavi\":{\"back\":\"#1d2025\",\"fore\":\"#ffffff\",\"logo\":\"#ffffff\"},\"dBody\":{\"back\":\"#0d1018\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-d.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}}}</script>\n    <style></style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"app\">\n    <noscript>\n        <h3>请<b style=\"color:#f00;\">不要禁用</b>脚本，否则网页无法正常加载</h3>\n    </noscript>\n        <article>\n        <h1>题解：P1425 小鱼的游泳时间</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: .75em;\">\n            <a rel=\"author\">MingDynasty_xiaohao2</a>\n            ·\n            <time datetime=\"2025-05-13T18:08:04+08:00\">2025-05-13 18:08:04</time>\n            ·\n            <a href=\"/article?category=2\">题解</a>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>题目传送门</p>\n<h2>解题思路：</h2>\n<p>这道题就是算两个时间的差。</p>\n<h4>设： a = 开始分， b = 开始时， c = 最终分， d = 最终时, x = 时的差， y = 分的差。</h4>\n<p>主要要判断分是否需要借位。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>如果要借位，则 d-1 ， c+60-a 就可以算出 y 。</li>\n<li>如果不需要结尾，直接 c-a 即可算出 y 。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>之后直接 d-b 即可算出 x 。</p>\n<h3>代码部分：</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">\n#include&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;\nusing namespace std;\nint main(){\n    int a,b,c,d;\n    cin&gt;&gt;a&gt;&gt;b&gt;&gt;c&gt;&gt;d;\n    int x,y;//用时\n    if(d&gt;=b){//不需要借位 \n         y=d-b;\n    } \n    else{//需要借位 \n        d+=60;\n        y=d-b;\n        c--;\n    }\n    x=c-a;//最终时间一定大于开始时间 \n    cout&lt;&lt;x&lt;&lt;\" \"&lt;&lt;y;//输出 \n    return 0;\n}</code></pre>\n    </article>\n</div>\n<script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML=\"window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a6028d0a19c0c8bd',t:'MTc5NTYyOTYwNQ=='};var l=window.parent.location,o;try{o=new URL(l.origin).origin}catch(e){try{o=new URL(new URL(l.href).origin).origin}catch(e){o=''}}var u='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js?ray=a6028d0a19c0c8bd',a=document.createElement('script');a.src=o?new URL(u,o).href:u;document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);\";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script></body>\n</html>\n",
